X-Wing Alliance recomp

The host and remaster come from the X-Wing vs TIE Fighter recomp
(https://github.com/sp00nznet/xvt-recomp), itself from the X-Wing and TIE Fighter
recomps; all run on pcrecomp's native32 runtime
(https://github.com/sp00nznet/pcrecomp), all MIT.

The XWAU build loads, but does not include, the X-Wing Alliance Upgrade
(https://www.xwaupgrade.com/, the XWAU team) and its hooks and renderer by
Jeremy Ansel (https://github.com/JeremyAnsel/xwa_hooks,
https://github.com/JeremyAnsel/xwa_ddraw_d3d11). The addresses in
tools/hook_jumps.txt and tools/hook_codewrites.txt were read from those hooks.

